ic","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.stable.steam [89cea1439]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable (89cea1439) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - AMD Ryzen 7 7700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.21 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWindows does not like it if your file has a trailing space or dot (do not know if other operating systems have the same issue) and prevents you from making them by removing the trailing characters. However, `FileAccess` and `DirAccess` fail to remove these trailing characters, and will create the invalid files.\n\n```gdscript\nvar dirAccess : DirAccess = DirAccess.open(\"user://\")\ndirAccess.make_dir(\"dot.\")\n```\n\n<img width=\"267\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc333e9c-be4f-40ff-8c0d-a4debca8f608\" />\n\n<br/><br/>\nUsing File Explorer, the file shows up but you cannot perform any actions on it; this is what happens if you try to open \"**dot.**\" for example:\n\n<img width=\"558\" height=\"178\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bab8cf5d-db01-4343-b826-b91179648ec0\" />\n\n<br/><br/>\nWhile `DirAccess` cannot open **dot.**, it can still delete it through the `remove` method. Another way to remove the invalid file is through the command below:\n\n<img width=\"813\" height=\"51\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f80876d-59ea-417a-b2c2-af59544ec48f\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use Windows\n2. Make a directory through `DirAccess` or make a file through `FileAccess`\n3. End the file name with dots or spaces\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116176/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116176/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}